# LAB AI OS Vision

LAB is an AI Operating System designed to orchestrate specialized AI models, software, and hardware through a unified capability layer.

Mission

Create an extensible AI operating system capable of completing any authorized task on a user's computer through planning, reasoning, memory, and automation.

Core Principles

- AI is modular.
- Models are replaceable.
- Everything is event driven.
- Everything is testable.
- Humans remain in control.